      "dcterms:title": "A Formula for the Colored Jones Polynomial of 2-Bridge Knots",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Takata, Toshie"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20080422",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We derive a formula for the colored Jones polynomial of 2-bridge knots. For a twist knot, a more explicit formula is given and it leads to a relation between the degree of the colored Jones polynomial and the crossing number.",
